(Advantages of Digital system over Analog system:) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
56. 743.8899999999999864 Td
(1. Ease of programmability:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
52. 730.3899999999999864 Td
(   The digital systems can be used for different applications by simply changing the program without additional changes in hardware.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
56. 716.8899999999999864 Td
(2. Reduction in cost of hardware:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
52. 703.3899999999999864 Td
(   The cost of hardware gets reduced by use of digital components and this has been possible due to advances in IC technology. With ICs the number of components that can be placed in a given area of Silicon are increased which helps in cost reduction.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
56. 689.8899999999999864 Td
(3. High speed:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
52. 676.3899999999999864 Td
(   Digital processing of data ensures high speed of operation which is possible due to advances in Digital Signal Processing.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
56. 662.8899999999999864 Td
(4. High Reliability:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
52. 649.3899999999999864 Td
(   Digital systems are highly reliable one of the reasons for that is use of error correction codes.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
56. 635.8899999999999864 Td
(5. Design is easy:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
52. 622.3899999999999864 Td
(   The design of digital systems which require use of Boolean algebra and other digital techniques is easier compared to analog designing.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
56. 608.8899999999999864 Td
(6. Result can be reproduced easily:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
52. 595.3899999999999864 Td
(   Since the output of digital systems unlike analog systems is independent of temperature, noise, humidity and other characteristics of components the reproducibility of results is higher in digital systems than in analog systems.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10.5 Tf
12.0749999999999993 TL
0.055 0.455 0.565 rg
52. 573.8899999999999864 Td
(Disadvantages of Digital Systems:) Tj
ET
