10.9249999999999989 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
52. 576.8899999999999864 Td
(The binary number has a radix of 2. As r = 2, only two digits are needed, and these are 0 and 1. In binary system weight is expressed as power of 2.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
52. 563.3899999999999864 Td
